Convinced that somebody had a sick sense of humour, or was 
trying to intimidate them, Popiel nevertheless telephoned Miko¬ 
lajczyk to ask whether there was any news of Sikorski’s arrival;

General 
Sikorski was due to arrive at 6.30 p.m. on this Saturday after¬ 
noon;

The hatch in the rear of the aircraft opened, and General 
Sikorski emerged, followed by his daughter and the five other 
Poles of his party;

The coffin lay in 
state in the Polish government’s headquarters in Kensington 
Palace Gardens until 14th July;

